          <div class="area-header area-F area-caratipo-a"><div class="banner-area banner-area-F"><span>SCIENZE E TECNOLOGIE</span></div>  <img loading="lazy" src="/sites/default/files/styles/scheda_cdl/public/2020-03/f6b-qbio.jpg?h=6acbff97&amp;itok=GFBGj4gy" width="1240" height="400" alt="Quantitative Biology" title="" class="img-responsive rs_skip" />


