          <div class="views-row"><div><span class="field--label">Contatti</span><div class="field--type-text-long"><ul><li>Academic Services Office<br>Milan - Via Celoria, 26<br><a href="https://informastudenti.unimi.it/" title="Apri la pagina in una nuova finestra" onclick="window.open(this.href);return false">https://informastudenti.unimi.it/</a><br><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#ea8883859e8f8983848e8b8788aa9f84838783c4839e"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="197b70766d7c7a70777d78747b596c7770747037706d">[email&#160;protected]</span></a><br>Desk by appointment, either online or in person. Please book your appointment via email: <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#e082898f948583898e84818d82a0958e898d89ce8994"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="f3919a9c8796909a9d97929e91b3869d9a9e9add9a87">[email&#160;protected]</span></a></li><li>Student administrative office<br>Milan - Via Celoria, 18<br><a href="https://www.unimi.it/en/study/student-services/welcome-desk-informastudenti/student-desks-locations-and-opening-hours" title="Apri la pagina in una nuova finestra" onclick="window.open(this.href);return false">https://www.unimi.it/en/study/student-services/welcome-desk-informastudenti/student-desks-locations-and-opening-hours</a><br><a href="tel:+390250325032">+390250325032</a><br>The front offices receive in the days and times indicated on the webpage</li><li>International Students Office<br>Milan - Via S. Sofia, 9/1<br><a href="https://www.unimi.it/en/international/coming-abroad/international-students-office-welcome-desk" title="Apri la pagina in una nuova finestra" onclick="window.open(this.href);return false">https://www.unimi.it/en/international/coming-abroad/international-students-office-welcome-desk</a></li><li>Industrial Biotechnology Academic Board<br><a href="http://www.unimi.it/en/education/faculties-and-schools/science-and-technology/industrial-biotechnology" title="Apri la pagina in una nuova finestra" onclick="window.open(this.href);return false">http://www.unimi.it/en/education/faculties-and-schools/science-and-technology/industrial-biotechnology</a></li><li>Boards<br>Anna Moroni, Matteo Brilli, Giovanni Nava (Masters degree admission); Veronica Gregis, Federica Marini (Student Mobility); Matteo Brilli (Study Plan).</li><li>Disability manager<br>Prof. Matteo Chiara</li></ul></div></div></div>

